	(text "GD32F303 四路无刷电机控制板\n系统总览 / 功能分区"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4058053c-051d-4097-9b12-cc865fd068f5")
	)
	(text "SYS-02  主控与通信互联"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 126 154 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "be7ea3c0-3589-4bf4-8377-39f2fee123b2")
	)
	(text "供电路径：24 V → BOARD_5V_RAW → +5V → +3V3\nUSB1_VBUS、USB2_VBUS 经各自 LM66100 接入 +5V。\n电机 24 V 回路与控制板共地；四路电机合计最大电流按 3 A 设计。\nEarth 表示机壳 / 金属安装板网络，是否接保护地 PE 由整机接线决定。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 190 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bfc0c3f4-7c9f-4d80-b7b9-46cb7c195993")
	)
	(text "POWER：24 V 输入、5 V / +3V3 电源、供电指示、机壳连接。\nMCU_Core：主控、时钟、启动 / 复位、SWD、SPI Flash。\nMotor_Comm：四路 PWM、DIR、BRAKE、FG 与电机接口。\nUSB_TTL_CH340：USB 转串口、MCU USB、5 V 电源汇合。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 270 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccf2680e-3306-45b5-92d8-67aa4a2946b6")
	)
	(text "SYS-01  电源系统"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142 64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d3ad192f-2a20-41b8-85ed-e46f5de64175")
	)
	(text "RS485：当前装配的自动收发接口。\nCAN：隔离 CAN 备用电路，当前 DNP。\nRS232：电平转换备用电路，当前 DNP。\n\n阅读约定\n实线框：功能分区；虚线框：备用不装配区域。\n具体装配状态以元件 DNP 属性为准。\n分区编号仅用于阅读，不改变网络连接。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 265 96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "宋体")
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ddcdee23-4a1a-4fe9-a3e5-a6fa8c5ba958")
	)
